---
---

<section id="about" class="py-20 px-6 bg-[#0a0a0a]">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">
      <!-- Image with effects -->
      <div class="relative flex justify-center">
        <div class="relative">
          <!-- Glow effect background -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00ff88] to-[#00ccff] rounded-full blur-3xl opacity-20 animate-pulse"></div>
          
          <!-- Border beam effect -->
          <div class="absolute -inset-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-[#00ff88] via-[#00ccff] to-[#00ff88] rounded-full opacity-75 blur-lg animate-gradient bg-[length:200%_auto]"></div>
          
          <!-- Image container -->
          <div class="relative w-80 h-80 rounded-full overflow-hidden border-4 border-[#00ff88] shadow-2xl shadow-[#00ff88]/50">
            <img 
              src="/perfil.png" 
              alt="Axel Cerkvenih"
              class="w-full h-full object-cover"
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <!-- About content -->
      <div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-6">
          About <span class="text-[#00ff88]">Me</span>
        </h2>
        
        <p class="text-[#a3a3a3] text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          I am a <span class="text-[#e5e5e5] font-semibold">security-focused engineer</span> based in Argentina 🇦🇷, 
          currently transitioning from a robust background in Full-Stack development to 
          <span class="text-[#00ff88] font-semibold">Application Security (AppSec)</span>.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-[#a3a3a3] text-lg mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          As an <span class="text-[#e5e5e5] font-semibold">Electronic Engineering student</span> at the National Technological University (UTN), 
          I bring a unique "under-the-hood" perspective to cybersecurity—understanding not just the code, 
          but the hardware and protocols that power it.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-[#a3a3a3] text-lg mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          I am proactive, collaborative, and driven by a <span class="text-[#00ff88] font-semibold">security-first mindset</span>. 
          I thrive in DevOps environments where I can automate vulnerability management, harden cloud infrastructures, 
          and advocate for best practices like the OWASP Top 10.
        </p>
        
        <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8">
          <div class="bg-[#111111] border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-[#00ff88] transition-colors">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#00ff88] mb-1">5+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-[#a3a3a3]">Years Experience</div>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-[#111111] border border-[#1a1a1a] rounded-lg p-4 hover:border-[#00ff88] transition-colors">
            <div class="text-3xl font-bold text-[#00ff88] mb-1">10+</div>
            <div class="text-sm text-[#a3a3a3]">Projects Completed</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <a 
          href="#contact" 
          class="inline-block px-8 py-3 bg-[#00ff88] text-[#0a0a0a] rounded-lg font-medium hover:bg-[#00cc6a] transition-colors"
        >
          Let's Work Together
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
